
Overview:

This is a desktop application developed using Java Swing and JDBC.

It allows a pharmacy to manage medicines, process sales, and generate reports.

Requirements:

Java JDK 8 or higher

MySQL Workbench

Setup:

Open MySQL Workbench or any MySQL tool

Run the file database.sql, to create the database and tables on mysql workbench

Login Info:

Admin:

Username: admin

Password: admin123

Cashier:

Username: cashier

Password: cash123

Running the Application:

Double click  ZaneleMabunda_pims.exe file provided.